                    <p>{repo.description}</p>
                  </>
                  <div class='repo-bottom'>
                    {repo.language ? (
                      <span class='repo-language'>
                        <i style={`background:${languageColors[repo.language] ?? '#8a8a91'}`} />
                        {repo.language}
                      </span>
                    ) : (
                      <span class='repo-language'>开源项目</span>
                    )}
                    <span class='repo-open' aria-hidden='true'>
                      查看仓库 ↗
                    </span>
                  </div>
                </article>
              ))
            }
          </div>
          <div id='no-results' class='no-results' hidden>
            <h3>暂时没有找到这个项目。</h3><p>试试其他关键词，或查看全部项目。</p><button
              type='button'
              id='reset-filters'
              class='button'>显示全部项目</button>
          </div>
          <noscript
            ><p class='noscript-note'>
              全部项目已列出；开启 JavaScript 可使用分类和搜索。
            </p></noscript
          >
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class='section closing' aria-labelledby='closing-title'>
        <div class='wrap reveal'>
          <span class='closing-symbol' aria-hidden='true'>↗</span><p class='eyebrow'>
            ALWAYS A WORK IN PROGRESS
          </p><h2 id='closing-title'>
            下一个想法，<br /><span class='muted'>在下一次提交里。</span>
          </h2><p>代码公开，探索继续。欢迎交流、提问，或一起构建。</p><a
            class='button'
